    "Settings › App carries the Dock count and the menu-bar list, each saying what it shows and what it never shows",
    "Wanigan tools per provider sets all, none or a chosen subset per profile",
    "the automation socket shows where it listens, keeps the token out of the window, and ledgers every call with its peer process",
